# Explicit previous-answer context for follow-up questions

Status: DONE
Milestone: Opt-in single-answer context; local source only
Dependencies: 39_INSTALLED_CLI_ANSWERS.todo, 45_OPT_IN_QUESTION_CLARIFICATION.todo, 49_CLEAR_AFTER_ASK.todo, 57_KEYBOARD_CONTROLS.todo

## Purpose

Implement the October10 14:41 request for a toggle immediately LEFT of Ask that sends the
currently displayed completed answer alongside the next reviewed question. This is not a
conversation archive, automatic transcript inclusion or permission for a model to use tools.

## Scope and acceptance

- [x] Previous answer is off on launch, session-only, available only with a completed answer
  and configured provider. Clicking it never submits; busy requests and active clarification lock it.
- [x] Explicit Ask snapshots the exact displayed completed answer. Keep only that answer,
  not its previous question, earlier answers, nested request context, notes or transcript.
- [x] Keep the toggle on across successful follow-ups; the next explicit Ask uses the newly
  displayed completed answer. Clear/provider changes reset it; failed/cancelled text is ineligible.
- [x] Clarify first snapshots before interpretation replaces the answer. Corrections,
  confirmation and explicit retry of the first interpretation reuse the SAME immutable text.
- [x] Nullable PreviousAnswer preserves the direct-null path. Nonblank strict Unicode,
  at most32768UTF-16 units, rejects rather than truncates. Fixed policy treats it as data;
  fresh sessions, tool denial, bounded streams and no automatic retry remain unchanged.
- [x] Setup/details shows the exact previously submitted context, not the latest replacement
  answer; snapshot label records its character count.
- [x] Built-in context on/off commands use the same guarded toggle handler. Keep the primary action row;
  below560WPF units use short Edit/Done/Reply and Copy captions with full accessible names,
  and80-wide Previous answer (118normally). Edit/Copy may wrap in their left group; Ask/Clear remain visible.
- [x] Synthetic provider/UI/keyboard/clarification failure and reset tests pass, with no real
  model/auth/audio calls. Record exact result counts and fixture identity below.
- [x] Current synthetic answer-context.png and README derivative are rendered; context/contact/minimum images reviewed;
  every changed/new first-party source/test/script has meaningful reviewed annotations.
- [x] Affected contracts/guides/book chapters, exact citations, README and public journal agree;
  full atlas/handbook HTML/PDF freshness and representative rendered review pass.

